@startuml evolution_timeline_horizontal
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #F8F8F8
  BorderColor #333333
  BorderThickness 2
}

skinparam arrow {
  Color #666666
  FontSize 10
}

component [**Generation 1**\nRule-Based\n1990s-2000s] as Gen1 #FFE6E6
component [**Generation 2**\nMachine Learning\n2000s-2010s] as Gen2 #E6F3FF
component [**Generation 3**\nAdaptive Learning\n2010s-Present] as Gen3 #E6FFE6
component [**Generation 4**\nAdversarial Learning\nOur Work] as Gen4 #FFF2E6

' Horizontal layout
Gen1 -right-> Gen2 : Evolution
Gen2 -right-> Gen3 : Evolution
Gen3 -right-> Gen4 : Evolution

note bottom of Gen1 : Static Rules\nSignature Detection
note bottom of Gen2 : Supervised Learning\nPattern Recognition
note bottom of Gen3 : Continuous Adaptation\nDynamic Threats
note bottom of Gen4 : PPO-Based\nStrategic Defense

@enduml
